program	enum145_raw_missing_value_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	case `B` of enum `Missing` needs an explicit value: every case of an enum with a backing type declares its own
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: case `B` of enum `Missing` needs an explicit value: every case of an enum with a backing type declares its own"
log	"  --> examples/enum145_raw_missing_value_error.saw:8:1"
log	"    |"
log	" 8 | enum Missing: UInt8 {"
log	"    | ^"
log	"   hint: write `case B = <int>`; declaring a backing type says the numbers are ABI, so none is assigned for you"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
